{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w00234"},"reason":"The question said the Normans introduced fallow deer across much of Europe. Genetic research shows that fallow deer were reintroduced to Britain from Anatolia before the Norman Conquest, so the Normans did not bring them. The Romans spread the species, which the Fishbourne isotope study confirms, so the question now credits the Romans only.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_fallow_deer"},{"url":"https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/antiquity/article/abs/tracking-animals-using-strontium-isotopes-in-teeth-the-role-of-fallow-deer-dama-dama-in-roman-britain/8EABBF6DF4A99F2706D29F9CF8E8CA10"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which deer, originally from the Mediterranean region, with a spotted summer coat and palmate antlers, were introduced across much of Europe by the Romans and Normans?","new":"Which deer, originally from the Mediterranean region, with a spotted summer coat and palmate antlers, were spread across much of Europe by the Romans?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welche ursprünglich aus dem Mittelmeerraum stammenden Hirsche mit geflecktem Sommerfell und Schaufelgeweih wurden von Römern und Normannen in weiten Teilen Europas eingebürgert?","new":"Welche ursprünglich aus dem Mittelmeerraum stammenden Hirsche mit geflecktem Sommerfell und Schaufelgeweih wurden von den Römern in weiten Teilen Europas verbreitet?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какие олени родом из Средиземноморья, с пятнистой летней шерстью и лопатообразными рогами, были расселены римлянами и норманнами по большей части Европы?","new":"Какие олени родом из Средиземноморья, с пятнистой летней шерстью и лопатообразными рогами, были расселены римлянами по большей части Европы?"}],"hash":"3122c69e03bf","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"2d66c169da498dcda603e525b031a94eab5390b09ba8c73a43d88e85c9b66df0"